# sha256 of every syft release asset the release job installs, cross-checked
# against the digests GitHub reports for the release. The version is in the
# filename, so bumping SYFT_VERSION in Taskfile.yml without regenerating this
# file fails the lookup rather than passing with a stale hash.
#
# Regenerate with: ./task syft-checksums
